River '''fishing spots''' can be found in the [[Streambound Cavern]] in [[Neypotzli]] and in [[Vampyrium]], and can be fished at for [[raw bream]] and [[leechfin]]s respectively. River fishing spots require aligning your net in the stream with where the fish are coming from to catch the most fish.

Bream will always be caught if they swim into your net, whereas leechfin have a chance of slipping past the net.

After 30 seconds of fishing without the player clicking on the fishing spot, you will time out and need to click again on the fishing spot.

